### Variables
@baseUrl = http://localhost:5000/api
# Replace this token with the one you get from login/register
@token = YOUR_JWT_TOKEN_HERE

### --- AUTHENTICATION ---

### 1. Register a new user
POST {{baseUrl}}/auth/register
Content-Type: application/json

{
    "name": "Test Student",
    "email": "student@university.edu",
    "password": "password123"
}

### 2. Login with user
# @name login
POST {{baseUrl}}/auth/login
Content-Type: application/json

{
    "email": "student@university.edu",
    "password": "password123"
}

### --- RESOURCES ---

### 3. Get all resources (Public)
GET {{baseUrl}}/resources

### 4. Get a single resource by ID (Replace ID with one from Get All Resources response)
GET {{baseUrl}}/resources/YOUR_RESOURCE_ID_HERE

### --- GAMIFICATION / VOTING ---

### 5. Upvote a resource (Protected)
POST {{baseUrl}}/votes
Content-Type: application/json
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}

{
    "resourceId": "YOUR_RESOURCE_ID_HERE",
    "type": "up"
}

### 6. Downvote a resource (Protected)
POST {{baseUrl}}/votes
Content-Type: application/json
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}

{
    "resourceId": "YOUR_RESOURCE_ID_HERE",
    "type": "down"
}
